  "description": {
    "en": "MSV Focus Hex Plus 25 is a more elastic and arm-friendly variation of the Focus Hex platform, offering approximately 25% greater elasticity than the original. Its hexagonal geometry and strong snapback provide high spin potential, while the softer response delivers increased power, ball pocketing and comfort. Low string movement helps maintain a stable stringbed. The 1.20 mm version emphasizes maximum power and feel, the 1.25 mm version provides the best overall balance, and the 1.30 mm version offers greater durability and stability.",

    "zh": "MSV Focus Hex Plus 25 是 Focus Hex 系列中更加柔和、更加护臂并强化力量输出的版本，官方表示其弹性相比标准 Focus Hex 提升约 25%。六边形结构配合强 Snap-back 提供优秀旋转潜力，而更高弹性则提升力量、持球感和舒适性，同时保持较低的线床移动。1.20毫米版本更强调力量和手感；1.25毫米综合表现最均衡；1.30毫米版本则更偏向耐久与稳定。"
  },

